# The build context is the repository root; send only what the Dockerfile copies.
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore; the legacy builder ignores this file
# and sends the whole tree, which is slower and changes nothing in the image.)
**
!CHANGELOG.md
!tockmox-ui/requirements.txt
!tockmox-ui/app/**
!ai-node/schema/*.json
**/__pycache__
